      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-326082",
      ":question/problem": "A home d\u00e9cor store lists a lamp with a regular price of $$60.00$. During a midweek sale, the lamp is sold at a discounted price that is $75%$ of the regular price. After the sale, the store applies a markup. If the discounted price is $80%$ of the marked price, what is the marked price of the lamp?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
