      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-326084",
      ":question/problem": "A pet store sells leashes at a retail price that is $180%$ of the wholesale cost. During a promotion, the leash is discounted. Before the discount, the retail price is $125%$ of the final selling price. If the final selling price of a leash is $$43.20$, what is the wholesale cost per leash?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
